The `prism_runtime/` directory contains a vendored minimal adaptation of the
official Prism inference code (hymm/), preserving original copyright and
license. Only package renaming and import cleanup were performed; no
algorithm or numerical changes were made.

prism_runtime/ 目录包含官方 Prism 推理代码 (hymm/) 的最小化适配副本，
保留原始版权和许可。仅进行了包重命名和导入清理，未做任何算法或数值改动。
